# Cache directory contents policy
# 
# TRACKED: This file itself (.gitignore) and submission.cfg
# IGNORED: YAML metadata files (for space reasons)
# 
# The YAML files are distributed compressed in the submission package.
# After extraction, run: do setup_qa_environment.do
# This decompresses fixtures.tar.gz and syncs metadata from main repo.
#
# Rationale:
#   - YAML files are auto-generated by wbopendata, update
#   - They are ~18MB per build cycle
#   - Tracked in main repo; no need to version in submission
#   - Reviewers decompress from fixtures.tar.gz on demand

__wbopendata_indicators.yaml
__wbopendata_sources.yaml
__wbopendata_topics.yaml
__wbopendata_parameters.yaml
